From 669d2bfe616d5ee1b49f0f9640d878bd277f97b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:23:14 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18e: default search provider and cancellable
 autocomplete

Read and set the profile's TemplateURLService default engine, classify command-bar input as URL or search, and run Chromium AutocompleteController queries with local providers plus gated remote suggest. One query per profile; the next query, Stop or profile release delivers exactly one cancelled terminal result. OTR IDs never read their original's history/bookmarks/shortcuts and never send suggest requests; setting the engine through OTR is rejected. ABI 1.26 / bridge 0.28.0; build p70, native provider get/set, classification, history and remote-suggest results, supersede/stop/close cancellation and OTR isolation pass.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
